{title: Dulhe Ka Sehra Suhana Lagta Hai}
{artist: Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan Dhadkan Nadeem Shravan}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Shehnaaiyon Ki [D]Sada Keh Rahi Hai,        [D]Khushi Ki Mubaarak [D]Ghadi Aa [Em]Gayi Hai
[Em]Saji Surkh Jodi Mein [D]Chaand Si Dulhan
[C]Zameen Pe [Am]Falak Se [D]Pari Aa [Em]Gayi Hai,        [Em]Dulhe Ka Sehra Suhaana [D]Lagta Hai
[C]Dulhan Ka To [D]Dil Deewana [Em]Lagta Hai
[G]Palbhar Mein Kaise Badalte Hain [D]Rishte,        [C]Ab To Har Apna Begaana [Em]Lagta Hai.
[Em]Dulhe Ka Sehra Suhaana [D]Lagta Hai.        [C]Dulhan Ka To [D]Dil Deewana [Em]Lagta Hai
[Em]Saat Phero Se Bandha Janmo Ka Ye [D]Bandhan
[D]Pyar Se Joda Hai Rab Ne Preet Ka [Em]Daman
[Em]Hai Nayi Rasme Nayi Kasme Nayi [D]Uljhan
[D]Hoth Hai Khamosh Lekin Keh Rahi [Em]Dhadkan,        [D]Dhadkan Dhadkan, [G]Dhadkan Dhadkan
[E]Dhadkan Meri [D]Dhadkan Dhadkan Teri [C]Dhadkan
[C]Dhadkan [G]Dhadkan [C]Dhadkan [Em]Dhadkan,        [Em]Dhadkan, Meri Dhadkan, Meri Dhadkan
[Em]Mushkil Ashkon Ko Chhupana [D]Lagta Hai,        [D]Dulhan Ka To Dil Dewana [Em]Lagta Hai
[G]Palbhar Mein Kaise Badalte [D]Hain Rishte,        [D]Ab To Har Apna Begana [Em]Lagta Hai
